			"Message": "docs(Land): Document Vine component, cross-platform Windows support, and Element submodule update\n\nExpand Documentation/GitHub/*.md to reflect the newly promoted Vine component as a first-class gRPC protocol library. Update BuildMatrix.md, BuildPipeline.md, EnvironmentVariables.md, and RustInfrastructure.md to include Vine in the workspace members, build artifact layout, tier-flag propagation table (NetworkMountainPort and NetworkCocoonPort consumed by Vine build.rs), and target triple matrix. Add Windows triplets (aarch64-pc-windows-msvc, x86_64-pc-windows-msvc) to RustInfrastructure.md BuildMatrix and rust-toolchain.toml targets.\n\nUpdate InterComponentProtocol.md to mark Element/Vine/Proto/Vine.proto as the canonical proto location, with Element/Mountain/Proto/Vine.proto as a local sync'd copy compiled by Mountain's build.rs. Refresh Architecture.md, Polyfills.md, Workflow.md, and the Workflow/ deep-dives to align path notation (Source/ prefixes) and Vine ownership language. Remove transient status markers from VSCode-API-Coverage-Matrix.md for stabilized entries.\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to dc253a15, incorporating the Echo dependency bump (@cloudflare/workers-types and ad-m/github-push-action).",
			"SHA": "52af5c9360ee205e998be3187f9e51e765fa0f18"
		},
